1. run dasebase in Mysql workbench and run stage 3.sql and amazon-prototype/backend/stage4_features.sql respectively
and change DB_CONFIG in backend/main.py


DB_CONFIG = {
    "host": "localhost",
    "user": "root",
    "password": "050419zkx", #replace with your own password
    "database": "Amazon",
}

2. Start FastAPI backend:

```
cd backend
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
```

4. Start Node frontend:

```
cd frontend
node server.js
```

4. Open the app in your browser:

```
http://localhost:3000
```
